tritors, surface aerotors, and thickeners; disc filters; and bulk solids handling valves, including slide gate, swing gate, double flap, casted square port, and fabricated valves. Its products are used in raw water and sea water intake systems, water and waste water pumping stations and treatment plants, storm water pumping stations, flood prevention and mitigation schemes, water transmission lines and also for power, steel, cement, paper and pulp, petrochemicals, chemical, and fertilizers and other process plants. The company was founded in 1948 and is headquartered in Indore, India."}}